WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.170
Bijul and I both know what needs to get done.

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.070
Whoever's in pole position tries to do the next thing.

3
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:05.460
It's like, hey,

4
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.610
the next thing is Samir's got to brush her hair.

5
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:08.870
We got to keep moving.

6
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.800
And so that is the very physical

7
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.110
daily manifestation of move the ball forward.

8
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:14.640
What the next thing

9
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.340
that needs to happen is, just move it.

10
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:16.930
Move it forward.

11
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.060
Both of us are busy,

12
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.670
where if we didn't have that,

13
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.160
I feel like a lot more would get dropped.

14
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.610
I'm not saying things don't get dropped,

15
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:24.740
but there's a little bit of,

16
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.800
if you get plugged in,

17
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.190
you have enough context to do the next thing.

18
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.380
There's not that much questioning of the last step.

19
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.290
And we're in a very nice spot.

20
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:33.810
Our kids are four and two,

21
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:34.730
so it's like

22
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.590
if they're wearing the wrong thing to school,

23
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:37.020
Bijul's not like,

24
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.730
"I can't believe you put them in whatever."

25
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.410
Also, we let the kids pick their own clothes.
